<title>UK: IMI Bank sets 2.0 billion Ffr six-year bond.</title>
<headline>IMI Bank sets 2.0 billion Ffr six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Agricole.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ISTITUTO MOBILAIRE ITALIANO BANK INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ISTITUTO MOBILIARE ITALIANO SPA  AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.375 PCT MATURITY    12.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.08    PAY DATE    12.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.505    SPREAD	+28 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX FULL FEES   1.875 PCT</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	BANQUE INDOSUEZ IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
